6.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 84.0 101.2\" y=\"25.4 20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> şübhesiz bunda - ya'ni bu Sûrede söylenen sözde <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"82\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 81.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 30.0 30.0 37.6 37.6 48.7 48.7 57.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"57.7 65.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> elbette bir ıbret dersi, bir va'z ve tezkir vardır<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"159\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 159.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 33.0 33.0 39.7 55.4 55.4 62.2 78.7 89.2 96.0 116.2 116.2 126.7 135.7 135.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.7 62.2 78.7 96.0 126.7 143.2\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> kalbi olan, ya'ni duyacak vicdanı olan kimse için<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"221\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 221.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 32.3 32.3 40.6 60.8 69.0 69.0 78.0 95.3 104.3 104.3 113.3 125.3 132.8 148.6 159.8 166.6 166.6 174.0 189.8 189.8 198.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"40.6 60.8 78.0 95.3 113.3 113.3 159.8 174.0 198.0 204.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> yahud şahid olarak kulak veren - ya'ni kendinden gafil olmıyarak şuuruna sahib, zihni hazır, şuhud halinde, duya duya dinliyen kimseler için. 38.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"121\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 120.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.3 30.0 30.0 36.7 52.4 52.4 59.3 59.3 66.0 86.3 97.4 97.4\" y=\"25.